<title>DUBAI: UAE and France to hold military exercises.</title>
<headline>UAE and France to hold military exercises.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United Arab Emirates and France will begin week-long joint military exercises in the Gulf Arab state on Tuesday, the French embassy said on Monday.</p>
<p>The wargames, code-named &quot;Gulf 96&quot;, are part of the military cooperation between the two countries, which are tied by a defence pact.</p>
<p>The UAE's official news agency WAM said earlier &quot;all French forces taking part in the exercise had completed their arrival&quot;.</p>
</text>
